1
00:03:04,444 --> 00:03:10,444
Mostly all new jokes.

2
00:06:08,888 --> 00:06:14,888
Naked Gun 33⅓: The Final Insult is a comedy, crime film directed by Peter Segal.

3
00:09:13,333 --> 00:09:19,333
Frank Drebin is persuaded out of retirement to go undercover in a state prison.

4
00:12:17,777 --> 00:12:23,777
There he has to find out what top terrorist, Rocco,
has planned for when he escapes.

5
00:15:22,222 --> 00:15:28,222
Adding to his problems, Frank's wife, Jane, is desperate for a baby.

6
00:18:26,666 --> 00:18:32,666
Lt. Frank Drebin, played by Leslie Nielsen.

7
00:21:31,111 --> 00:21:37,111
Jane Spencer, played by Priscilla Presley.

8
00:24:35,555 --> 00:24:41,555
Ed Hocken, played by George Kennedy.

9
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:46,000
Nordberg, played by O. J. Simpson.

10
00:30:44,444 --> 00:30:50,444
Rocco, played by Fred Ward.

11
00:33:48,888 --> 00:33:54,888
Muriel, played by Kathleen Freeman.

12
00:36:53,333 --> 00:36:59,333
Naked Gun 33⅓: The Final Insult is a 1994 American crime comedy film directed by Peter Segal (in
his directorial debut) and written by Pat Proft, David Zucker and Robert LoCash.

13
00:39:57,777 --> 00:40:03,777
The film is the third installment in the Naked Gun film series,
which was based on the television series, Police Squad!

14
00:43:02,222 --> 00:43:08,222
It is the sequel to The Naked Gun: From the Files of Police Squad!

15
00:46:06,666 --> 00:46:12,666
(1988) and The Naked Gun 2½: The Smell of Fear (1991).

16
00:49:11,111 --> 00:49:17,111
The Final Insult is the first film in the series that is not directed by David
Zucker, with him serving as producer and co-writer instead.

17
00:52:15,555 --> 00:52:21,555
Police Squad!

18
00:55:20,000 --> 00:55:26,000
co-creators Jim Abrahams and Jerry Zucker returned as executive producers.

19
00:58:24,444 --> 00:58:30,444
The "33⅓" in the title is a reference to the number of
rotations per minute at which phonograph records play.

20
01:01:28,888 --> 01:01:34,888
Leslie Nielsen returns as Lieutenant Frank Drebin (his original character from
Police Squad!), along with Priscilla Presley as Jane Spencer Drebin, O.

21
01:04:33,333 --> 01:04:39,333
Simpson (in his last feature film before his arrest on murder charges three months
later) as Officer Nordberg, and George Kennedy as Captain Ed Hocken.

22
01:07:37,777 --> 01:07:43,777
Newcomers to the series Fred Ward, Anna Nicole Smith, and Kathleen Freeman co-star
as a gang of bombers set to blow up the Academy Awards ceremony.

23
01:10:42,222 --> 01:10:48,222
Raye Birk reprises his role as Pahpshmir from The Naked
Gun: From the Files of Police Squad!

24
01:13:46,666 --> 01:13:52,666
This was the last Naked Gun film to have any involvement by Zucker,
Abrahams and Zucker before Abrahams' death in 2024.

25
01:16:51,111 --> 01:16:57,111
The film explores themes of police, undercover,
parody, sexual humor, slapstick comedy.

26
01:19:55,555 --> 01:20:01,555
The tone is lighthearted.
